  "description": "As the Mysterious Knight revealed his face, King Arthur was speechless. Mordred, son to Arthur and Morgana, stood before his father as his lance evolved into a final destructive form. In the distance, a horde of mechanical knights appeared, grouping behind Mordred. “Father, destiny has come. On this day, I will take NeoAvalon from you!” he said with a resolute voice. As Mordred charged at Arthur, the king responded by whispering something to his photon sword and unleashing Excalibur’s full power. A grand duel ensued, blasts flew through the atmosphere, swords and spears brimming with great power clashed and the ground trembled. Finally, Mordred pierced Arthur's chest piece with his plasma fusion lance. Arthur used his final strength to impale Mordred using Excalibur’s ultimate attack. As father and son breathed their final breaths, Mordred whispered “Father, I am sorry...”",
